proposal/proposal_state_changed_subject.txt <pre><code>    Proposal state update: {{ proposal_name }} - {{ new_state }}
</code></pre> proposal/proposal_state_changed_message.txt <pre><code>    Dear {{ proposal_creator_name }},

    The state of your proposal "{{ proposal_name }}" in call "{{ call_name }}" has been updated.

